<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Booking Confirmed</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f7fa;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .header .icon {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
      color: #334155;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .content p {
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .order-card {
      background-color: #f0fdf4;
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .order-card .label {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .order-card .value {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #059669;
      word-break: break-all;
    }
    .button-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 35px 0;
    }
    .button {
      background-color: #10b981;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 24px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="icon">&#10003;</div>
      <h1>Booking Confirmed!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>Great news! Your booking has been successfully confirmed. Here are your details:</p>

      <div class="order-card">
        <div class="label">Booking ID</div>
        <div class="value">{{orderId}}</div>
      </div>

      <p>We're getting everything ready for you. You can view your booking details anytime from your dashboard.</p>

      <div class="button-container">
        <a href="#" class="button">View My Booking</a>
      </div>

      <p>If you have any questions or need to make changes, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>
      <p>Thank you for choosing us!<br><br>Best regards,<br><strong>The Booking Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; 2026 All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>You received this email because a booking was confirmed on your account.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
